  "description": "The happiest time for Cheon, a slave, was when he took care of the young master Se-Young like a younger brother. After parting ways with Se-Young, he was bullied by his master for a long time and was destined to be offered up as a sacrifice to the general. However, the general he met before his eyes looked familiar? The grown Se-Young whispers to Cheon, who is happy to be reunited with the master. \n\n *\"You are mine now, mister. Everything, even the deepest part of my body.\"*\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Peanutoon's Geosi,Girong Danpyeonseon (거시,기록 단편선) Collection.*",
